;; slowshield.org: canonical host of the website (Worker `slowshield-website`).
;; Import: Cloudflare > slowshield.org > DNS > Records > Import and Export, "Proxy imported DNS records" on.
;; The apex has no address record here on purpose: attaching the Worker custom domain creates it, and an apex
;; record left in the zone blocks that. www only has to resolve to Cloudflare; a Redirect Rule answers it.
;;
;; No mail is sent or received on any name in this domain, and receivers are told to reject mail that claims
;; otherwise: null MX (RFC 7505) and SPF "-all" on the apex, on www (which has its own records, so the wildcard
;; does not cover it) and on every other name (wildcard); every DKIM key revoked; DMARC reject for the domain
;; and all subdomains, with strict alignment.

www.slowshield.org.	1	IN	A	192.0.2.1 ; cf_tags=cf-proxied:true
slowshield.org.	1	IN	MX	0 .
www.slowshield.org.	1	IN	MX	0 .
*.slowshield.org.	1	IN	MX	0 .
slowshield.org.	1	IN	TXT	"v=spf1 -all"
www.slowshield.org.	1	IN	TXT	"v=spf1 -all"
*.slowshield.org.	1	IN	TXT	"v=spf1 -all"
*._domainkey.slowshield.org.	1	IN	TXT	"v=DKIM1; p="
_dmarc.slowshield.org.	1	IN	TXT	"v=DMARC1; p=reject; sp=reject; adkim=s; aspf=s"
